<div class="section-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">HX-Trigger response header</p>
    <h2>Server-triggered toast notifications</h2>
  </div>
  <p>The action returns no body. The response header raises an event that another htmx listener uses to fetch the toast.</p>
</div>

<div class="toast-demo">
  <div class="button-row">
    <button class="button button-primary" type="button" hx-post="/api/toast/trigger?kind=success" hx-swap="none">Trigger success toast</button>
    <button class="button button-ghost" type="button" hx-post="/api/toast/trigger?kind=warning" hx-swap="none">Trigger warning toast</button>
  </div>
  <div
    id="toast-list"
    class="toast-list"
    hx-get="/api/toast/latest"
    hx-trigger="showToast from:body"
    hx-swap="afterbegin"
    aria-live="polite"
  ></div>
</div>

<details class="code-panel">
  <summary>Header event listener</summary>
  <pre><code>POST /api/toast/trigger
HX-Trigger: showToast

&lt;div hx-get="/api/toast/latest"
     hx-trigger="showToast from:body"
     hx-swap="afterbegin"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
</details>
